{"run_id": "20260828T204108-hepkg-53962", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "38b6e0da9591", "git_sha": "fbd64c1-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 4 analyses that estimate a background using an ABCD method:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Modified ABCD estimate\n- **2011.07812**: ABCD data-driven background estimation method\n- **2012.01581**: Data-driven ABCD-style ratio method using eight non-overlapping regions (A-H) defined by three near-uncorrelated selection criteria\n- **2511.11853**: ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\n\nThe terms \"ABCDStyleSideband\" and \"MatrixMethodOverIndependentRegions\" are not in the facet vocabulary, so they do not match any papers. However, the above papers cover variations of the ABCD method, including matrix and sideband approaches.\n\nThese are the papers that use an ABCD method or similar techniques.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "facets", "args": {"field": "background_methods", "values": ["ABCD", "ABCDStyleSideband", "MatrixMethodOverIndependentRegions"], "mode": "any", "category": "search"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.027}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": ["2004.01678", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2511.11853", "a-h", "abcd", "abcd-style", "background", "control", "criteria", "data", "data-driven", "defined", "eight", "estimate", "estimation", "fits", "matrix", "method", "modified", "near-uncorrelated", "non-overlapping", "parametric", "ratio", "regions", "search", "selection", "three", "using", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9452, "completion_tokens": 249, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.559364209882915, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.559364209882915, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9701.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "judged_precision": 0.75, "judged_recall": 0.3333333333333333, "judged_f1": 0.46153846153846156, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.23333333333333334, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 0.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260828T204108-hepkg-53962", "qid": "gabriel-gf-03", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "38b6e0da9591", "git_sha": "fbd64c1-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following 12 analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis: 'Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector', 'Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector', 'Search for displaced leptons in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector', 'Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector', 'Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$ -parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector', 'Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more $b$ -jets in 139 fb -1 of proton–proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector', 'Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector', 'Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector', 'Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV', 'Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$', 'Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state', and 'Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$'.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2207.12246", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2408.03744", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "HistFitter", "kind": "statistical_method"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.083}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.03}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:de78c3f754afbc4965051e45", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b", "hepkg:result:36007f1a5d23adf160cf4b1d", "hepkg:result:46ee77edd095181b02474a60", "hepkg:result:d0ff6542be328ba2a125a5cb", "hepkg:result:d5288b5bc0407b0b2005d131"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:method:cms_combine_tool", "hepkg:method:combine-tool", "hepkg:method:combine_tool", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile_likelihood_fit", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination", "hepkg:statistical_method:combine_roofit_roostats_tool", "hepkg:statmethod:multi-bin-fit", "hepkg:statmethod:profile-likelihood-fit"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:cms_combine_tool", "hepkg:method:combine-tool", "hepkg:method:combine_tool", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile-likeli